		<item>
		<title>Watch The Rock put Pat McAfee through a table during ESPN&#8217;s College Gameday</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398098-watch-the-rock-put-pat-mcafee-through-table/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398098-watch-the-rock-put-pat-mcafee-through-table/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 18:10:49 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[College GameDay]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[ESPN]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Pat McAfee]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[The Rock]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398098</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>During his appearance on ESPN’s College GameDay as the guest picker on Saturday, for the University of Miami&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398098-watch-the-rock-put-pat-mcafee-through-table/">Watch The Rock put Pat McAfee through a table during ESPN&#8217;s College Gameday</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">During his appearance on <a href="https://x.com/CollegeGameDay/status/2124162522672406538?a=L61Govk4O9CePK-kkiM&amp;s=20">ESPN’s College GameDay</a> as the guest picker on Saturday, for the University of Miami Hurricane&#8217;s game, The Rock put Pat McAfee through a table. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Rock confronted McAfee, who was talking trash about the University of Miami.  After The Rock hugged McAfee, he picked him up and put him through a table with The Rock Bottom. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The video below will start at the 10:00 mark, leading into McAfee being put through the table around 10:38. </p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe title="Dwayne &amp;apos;The Rock&amp;apos; Johnson interrupts Pat McAfee on College GameDay! &#x1f5e3;" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/SYzCDWitys4?start=600&amp;feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">He was a member of the 1991 team that won a national championship. He played in 39 games with one start and recorded 4.5 sacks and 77 tackles.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The Rock <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/featured-top-story/397849-the-rock-announces-appearance-for-survivor-series-wargames/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">announced</a> during Wednesday’s episode of The Pat McAfee Show, he will be at Survivor Series: WarGames, which will emanate from Daikin Park in Houston, Texas on Saturday, November 28.  </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">A <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/397984-report-backstage-update-on-the-rock-appearing-at-wwe-survivor-series/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">report this past Thursday</a> noted that The Rock announcing his upcoming Survivor Series appearance was unexpected by a number of individuals at WWE headquarters, including members of the company’s live event promotions department.</p>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe title="&amp;apos;The Rock&amp;apos; sharing some wisdom to other student athletes &#x1f91d;" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/_WU_wJy6nDQ?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
https://youtu.be/mamV1yqV7nc?si=BQIWeERQ4jSu2zTi
</div></figure>



<figure class="wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio"><div class="wp-block-embed__wrapper">
<iframe loading="lazy" title="Wow &#x1f92f;" width="1200" height="675" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ke4De9SBBvI?feature=oembed" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen></iframe>
</div></figure>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398098-watch-the-rock-put-pat-mcafee-through-table/">Watch The Rock put Pat McAfee through a table during ESPN&#8217;s College Gameday</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398098-watch-the-rock-put-pat-mcafee-through-table/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
		<item>
		<title>AEW Dynamite viewership and key demo for Full Gear fallout show</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/398094-aew-dynamite-viewership-full-gear-fallout-show/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/398094-aew-dynamite-viewership-full-gear-fallout-show/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jerome Wilen]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:46:28 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AEW News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[AEW]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Dynamite]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[ratings]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[TBS]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398094</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>This past Wednesday&#8217;s AEW Dynamite on TBS, which was the fallout show for Full Gear came in with&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/aew-news/398094-aew-dynamite-viewership-full-gear-fallout-show/">AEW Dynamite viewership and key demo for Full Gear fallout show</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">This past Wednesday&#8217;s AEW Dynamite on TBS, which was the fallout show for Full Gear came in with 727,000 viewers and a 0.19 rating. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The previous week&#8217;s show had 742,000 viewers and a 0.19.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Wednesday&#8217;s Dynamite, which ranked no. 2 for the night on cable in the key demographic, emanated from the Mission Ballroom in Denver, Colorado with a sold-out crowd of 2,500. </p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Source: <a href="https://wrestlenomics.com/articles/2026/aew-dynamite-nov-18-on-tbs-727000-viewers-0-19-p18-49-rating-tv-ratings-analysis/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Wrestlenomics</a></p>



