		<item>
		<title>Report: WWE planning tryouts in London for January 2027</title>
		<link>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398091-report-wwe-planning-tryouts-in-london-for-january-2027/</link>
					<comments>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398091-report-wwe-planning-tryouts-in-london-for-january-2027/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Alex Kahrs]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:47:16 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[WWE News]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[England]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Europe]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[live events]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[London]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[tryouts]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[WWE]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.wrestleview.com/?p=398091</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p>Following a promotional poster that surfaced on November 20, Bryan Alvarez of F4WOnline has confirmed that WWE will&#8230;</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398091-report-wwe-planning-tryouts-in-london-for-january-2027/">Report: WWE planning tryouts in London for January 2027</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Following a promotional poster that surfaced on November 20, Bryan Alvarez of <a href="https://www.f4wonline.com/news/wwe/wwe-planning-london-talent-tryouts-for-january-2027/">F4WOnline</a> has confirmed that WWE will hold its next set of talent tryouts in January 2027.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The poster notes that selected candidates will be contacted by the company with more information, as they head to Europe for an upcoming tour.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The January 15, 2027 episode of SmackDown will emanate from Forest National in Brussels, Belgium, with live events planned in Poland and the Netherlands leading to Raw from Glasgow on January 18.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">England will play host to SmackDown on January 22 from Co-op Live in Manchester, followed by live events in Sweden and Hungary before concluding the tour in Dublin, Ireland for Raw on January 25.</p>
<p>The post <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398091-report-wwe-planning-tryouts-in-london-for-january-2027/">Report: WWE planning tryouts in London for January 2027</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.wrestleview.com">WWE News, WWE Results, AEW News, AEW Results</a>.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
					<wfw:commentRss>https://www.wrestleview.com/wwe-news/398091-report-wwe-planning-tryouts-in-london-for-january-2027/feed/</wfw:commentRss>
			<slash:comments>0</slash:comments>
		
		
			</item>
